  {
    "RowId": 43900,
    "Text": "The president must pay for his crimes! Give him what for, Champion!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43901,
    "Text": "His arm has a life of its own! Is this the power of the mythical Lindwurm?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43902,
    "Text": "His arm is slithering out! That's disgusting!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43903,
    "Text": "The Lindwurm's scattered gore is expanding!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43904,
    "Text": "Watch out! That is one cruel coil..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43905,
    "Text": "Oh no! The champion's been crushed!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43906,
    "Text": "His arms are snaking 'round the ring! What's he planning!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43907,
    "Text": "Dear me, the ring's in pieces!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43908,
    "Text": "Oh no, the gore has latched onto the champion! Don't panic!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43909,
    "Text": "The Lindwurm's completely healed! What outrageous regenerative power!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43910,
    "Text": "What the─? Could the Lindwurm's regeneration be out of control!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43911,
    "Text": "His power continues to run amok! Again and again he remakes his arms!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43912,
    "Text": "Is there no limit to his regenerative capacity!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43913,
    "Text": "_rsv_43913_-1_1_0_0_S13095D61_E13095D61"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43914,
    "Text": "They've been struck with venom! But they can weather it─they must!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43915,
    "Text": "Something revolting this way comes!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43916,
    "Text": "The battle is decided! Victory goes to the champion!"
  },
  {
